1) The above Statement of Unaudited Financial Results (“the Statement”) of Veegaland Developers Limited (the "Company") has been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their meetings held on 5 October 2026 and 6 October 2026 respectively. The statutory auditors of the Company have carried out limited review of the results for the quarter ended 30 June 2026. &lt;br /&gt; 
2) The Statement has been prepared in accordance with the recognition and measurement principles laid down in Indian Accounting Standard 34 (Ind AS 34) “Interim Financial Reporting” as prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013, as amended, read with relevant rules issued thereunder and other accounting principles generally accepted in India and in compliance with Regulation 33 of the Securities Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended (the ‘Listing Regulations’).  &lt;br /&gt; 
3) Subsequent to the quarter ended 30 June 2026, the Company completed its Initial Public Offering (IPO) of 1,50,00,000 equity shares of face value of Rs. 10 each at an issue price of Rs. 140 per equity share. The equity shares of the Company were listed on the National Stock Exchange of India Limited (NSE) and BSE Limited (BSE) on 18 September 2026. Accordingly, the Statement is the first Statement of Unaudited Financial Results reported by the Company in accordance with the Listing Regulations. &lt;br /&gt; 
4) During the quarter ended 30 September 2025, the Board of Directors, at its meeting held on 21 August 2025, allotted 17,50,000 Equity Shares of face value of Rs. 10 each (“Equity Shares”) under Rights Issue at an issue price of Rs. 1,000 per Equity Share. Subsequently, pursuant to the approval of the shareholders accorded on 22 September 2025, allotted 2,70,00,000 fully paid-up Equity Shares as bonus shares in the ratio of 4:1, i.e., four bonus Equity Shares for every one Equity Share held by the eligible shareholders on the Record Date. &lt;br /&gt; 
5) The figures for the quarter ended 30 June 2025 have been compiled by management in accordance with the recognition and measurement principles of Ind AS 34 Interim Financial Reporting and have not been subjected to review or audit by the Statutory Auditors. However, management has exercised necessary due diligence to ensure that these figures provide a true and fair view of the Company's affairs. &lt;br /&gt; 
6) The figures for the quarter ended 31 March 2026 represents the balancing figures between the audited figures for the full financial year ended 31 March 2026 and the unpublished audited figures for the nine months ended 31 December 2025.  &lt;br /&gt; 
7) The Chief Operating Decision Maker (CODM) reviews the Company's operations as a single business segment, namely real estate development and allied activities, all of which are carried out in India. Accordingly, management has concluded that the Company has only one reportable segment under Ind AS 108 Operating Segments, and the entity-wide disclosures presented in these financial statements satisfy the requirements of the Standard. &lt;br /&gt; 
8) The Statement is available on the BSE Limited website (URL: www.bseindia.com), the National Stock Exchange of India Limited website (URL: www.nseindia.com) and on the Company's website (URL: https://www.veegaland.com). &lt;br /&gt; 
9) Previous period/year figures have been regrouped/rearranged, wherever considered necessary, to conform to the classification/disclosure adopted in the current period/year and such regrouping/ reclassification are not material.</in-capmkt:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock><in-capmkt:RemarksForDebtServiceCoverageRatio contextRef="OneD">EBIT Covers Debt Service requirements 8.67 times</in-capmkt:RemarksForDebtServiceCoverageRatio><in-capmkt:RemarksForInterestServiceCoverageRatio contextRef="OneD">EBIT Covers Finance Cost 12.79 times</in-capmkt:RemarksForInterestServiceCoverageRatio><in-capmkt:DescriptionOfOtherExpenses contextRef="OneExpenses1D">Total other expenses</in-capmkt:DescriptionOfOtherExpenses><in-capmkt:OtherExpenses contextRef="OneExpenses1D" decimals="-3" unitRef="INR">57612000</in-capmkt:OtherExpenses><in-capmkt:IncomeTaxRelatingToItemsThatWillNotBeReclassifiedToProfitOrLoss contextRef="OneD" decimals="-5" unitRef="INR">0</in-capmkt:IncomeTaxRelatingToItemsThatWillNotBeReclassifiedToProfitOrLoss><in-capmkt:IncomeTaxRelatingToItemsThatWillBeReclassifiedToProfitOrLoss contextRef="OneD" decimals="-5" unitRef="INR">0</in-capmkt:IncomeTaxRelatingToItemsThatWillBeReclassifiedToProfitOrLoss><in-capmkt:OtherComprehensiveIncome contextRef="OneD" decimals="-5" unitRef="INR">0</in-capmkt:OtherComprehensiveIncome></xbrli:xbrl>